          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "62d7f6e5-a22f-44c5-8526-0c1e9c09422c",
      "name": "Dispatch Enabled",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        3008,
        656
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "return {json:{...$json,dispatch_result:'NOT_SENT',setup_required:'Select WF04 in Run WF04 Dispatcher, then set dispatch_enabled=true. This command remains PENDING; dispatch this existing command_id, do not create another command.'}};"
      },
      "id": "5a3b2f58-4cc4-4916-a5f0-fa0bc957db3c",
      "name": "Pending - Connect WF04",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        3264,
        912
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## REQUIRED SETUP / HONEST LIMITS\n1. Default dispatch_enabled=false: creates PENDING commands only. To send: select Vinh's WF04 in Run WF04 Dispatcher, then set dispatch_enabled=true in Prepare Automation Input.\n2. WF04 must accept command_id, device_id=ESP32_A101, device_uuid, command_type, action; publish existing command; update SENT. WF05 must ACK that command_id. This file does not pretend dispatch success = device ACK.\n3. Unacknowledged PENDING/SENT blocks new commands; after 120 s it reports PENDING_TIMEOUT_REQUIRES_REVIEW. Review/recover the existing command, not another new command.\n4. MANUAL hold = 300 s per actuator; cooldown = 20 s. This is a temporary override, NOT a persistent AUTO/MANUAL dashboard setting.\n5. Guards use latest 200 commands (all devices). Not atomic: concurrent executions can race. Serialize demo executions; production needs backend lock/idempotency and per-device queries. ACK history is not a physical state sensor; device resets can invalidate it.\n6. No automatic retry of POSTs. Incidents and reliable state/mode endpoints remain team integration work.\nBackend remains unchanged.",
        "height": 580,
        "width": 680
      },
      "id": "3995aff8-80a0-4a8c-be2a-52a2b33e092d",
      "name": "README - IMPORT AND LIMITS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    }
